.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Provides a lightweight reentrant futex-like synchronization primitive\&. 

A \fR\fBLightFutex\fP\fP combines a fast userspace lock word with an optional kernel-assisted wait path via AutoResetEvent\&. The lock is reentrant for the owning thread: if the current thread already holds the futex, additional lock attempts succeed immediately without modifying the internal state\&. 

.PP
The futex is considered free when \fRm_state == -1\fP\&. Any non-negative value represents the thread ID of the owning thread\&. 
.PP
