.SS "bool SystemEx\&.Threading\&.LightFutex\&.Lock (\fBTimeOut\fP span)"

.PP
Attempts to acquire the futex within the specified timeout\&. If the futex is already held, the call succeeds only if the current thread is the owner (reentrant acquisition)\&. Otherwise, the fast userspace CAS path is attempted\&. If contention persists, the thread enters the wait path until signaled or the timeout expires\&. 

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIspan\fP The maximum time to wait for the futex\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
\fRtrue\fP if the futex was acquired or reentered; otherwise, \fRfalse\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP

